71725_crt_0EW0W.jpg","actor_ids":[],"name_cn":"伊甸学园","summary":"一家名校。学校会定期召开联谊会，因此也成为了政财两界的大人物云集的社交场所。\r\n全校学生约有2500人，是从6～19岁的全13学年制，以培养学术、体育、艺术等各个领域的顶尖人员为目标的教育机构。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"伊甸学园","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":196747,"name":"西国情報局対東課","relation":"闲角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/8e/8c/196747_crt_9GN17.jpg","actor_ids":[],"name_cn":"西国情报局对东课","summary":"简称“WISE”，是一个根据潜入东国的间谍等情报人员传来的信息，在暗中削弱企图恶化与西国关系的个人及团体的组织，凭借最先进的电子技术和情报人员出色的任务执行能力，守护着两国的和平。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"西国情报局对东课","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":196770,"name":"国家保安局","relation":"闲角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/7c/71/196770_crt_QanaC.jpg","actor_ids":[],"name_cn":"国家保安局","summary":"简称“SSS”，是以维持东国国内治安为目的的组织，其主要工作为搜捕间谍及监视市民等。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"国家保安局","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":226992,"name":"ナレーション","relation":"旁白","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/64/ff/226992_crt_mDGMN.jpg","actor_ids":[5171,7602,58219,79232],"name_cn":"旁白 (间谍过家家)","summary":"","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"旁白 (间谍过家家)","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":226993,"name":"アナウンス","relation":"旁白","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/ff/e3/226993_crt_I6O2k.jpg","actor_ids":[25115],"name_cn":"广播 (间谍过家家)","summary":"","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"广播 (间谍过家家)","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"}],"relations":[{"id":279379,"name":"SPY×FAMILY","name_cn":"间谍过家家","relation":"书籍","type":1,"image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/c6/ab/279379_Bjc7O.jpg","__dataclass__":"Relation"},{"id":377129,"name":"喜劇","name_cn":"","relation":"片尾曲","type":